/*@meta

Author:
'Sound Dust'

Description:
'Nasty west coast style modulation'

Usage:
'MW weird\r\nAT bend'

Categories:
'Pads:Atonal, Pads:Distorted, Pads:Drones, Pads:Evolving, Pads:Rhythmic, FX:Glitch & Weird, FX:Noise & Rumble, FX:Tension'

